          "explanation": "The doctor named key preoperative result gaps and required formal retrieval rather than interpreting incomplete paperwork.",
          "quote": "血肌酐/肾功能、糖化血红蛋白、尿常规、尿培养"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met: the doctor distinguished ordered/mentioned items from reviewed results and repeatedly sought formal kidney function, HbA1c, urine testing/culture, residual urine, urodynamics, and related preoperative results before surgical decisions.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_preoperative_result_verification",
      "status": "met"
