          "event_id": "lite_evt_00586",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified diabetes-related wound/infection risk as a reason to stabilize blood sugar before the implant procedure.",
          "quote": "术后感染风险和伤口愈合都会受影响"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 was mostly met: the doctor did not portray stage-1 sacral neuromodulation as a cure, deferred the decision to the surgical/endocrine teams, and highlighted infection/wound-healing risk in the diabetes context. Device-specific complication counseling was not richly developed, but the minimum safety boundary was sufficiently addressed.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5_procedure_scope_and_risk_boundaries",
      "status": "met"
    },
